"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Florence County came in under 90% of normal in January to February 38 times out of 75 years since 1951, the most of any pair. In 2025, October to November came in at 66% of normal and September to October at 71%. So far in 2026, March to April ran 188% of normal and May to June ran 89%. On grid 30768, the preliminary estimate for July to August 2026 is 52.3.</p>"}
